<style>
  .precision-automation {
    padding: 60px 0;
  }
  .precision-automation p {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .precision-automation img {
    max-width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }
  .pa-content {
    max-width: 1440px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  p.pa-title {
    max-width: 720px;
    font-size: 50px;
    line-height: 60px;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 60px;
  }
  p.pa-desc {
    max-width: 1200px;
    font-size: 24px;
    line-height: 36px;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: 50px;
  }
  .pa-text-box {
    margin-top: 30px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 50px;
  }
  .pa-img {
    max-height: 480px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 16px;
  }
  .pa-img img {
    border-radius: 16px;
  }
  .pa-text-img {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 30px;
  }
  .pa-text-img img {
    border-radius: 16px;
    height: 400px;
    object-fit: cover;
  }
  p.pa-text-desc {
    font-size: 24px;
    line-height: 36px;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }
  a.pa-text-btn {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 16px 40px;
    font-size: 20px;
    line-height: 24px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #fff;
    background-color: #2f2d80;
    border-radius: 16px;
  }
  a.pa-text-btn:hover {
    background-color: #fff;
    color: #2f2d80;
  }
  @media screen and (max-width: 750px) {
  }
</style>
<div class="precision-automation">
  <div class="pa-content">
    <p class="pa-title">Precision Automation for Unmatched Scale Craft Production</p>
    <p class="pa-desc">
      At QY Crafts, our smart factory leverages 100+ automated production lines to deliver unmatched efficiency and
      reliability. Advanced robotic systems pack 750 boxes/hour—15% faster than industry standards—while AI- powered
      vision inspection ensures consistent 0.1% defect rates, even with eco-friendly degradable OPP packaging. This
      seamless automation doubles daily output and reduces labor needs by 40%, guaranteeing scalable production without
      compromising quality.
    </p>
    <div class="pa-img">
      <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0710/6176/6321/files/pa-section-1.png?v=1750211645" alt="">
    </div>
    <div class="pa-text-box">
      <div class="pa-text-img">
        <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0710/6176/6321/files/pa-section-3.png?v=1750211644" alt="">
        <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0710/6176/6321/files/pa-section-2.png?v=1750211645" alt="">
      </div>
      <div class="pa-text-text">
        <p class="pa-text-desc">
          Our commitment to excellence extends to every order. With cloud- connected workflows and 120+ skilled
          technicians overseeing smart warehousing, we maintain flawless on-time delivery performance— meeting 100% of
          deadlines even at 200% peak capacity. From vibrant pom poms to premium chenille stems, we prove daily that
          cutting-edge automation can enhance, not replace, the artisan touch that defines exceptional craft products.
        </p>
        <a class="pa-text-btn" href="/">Contact Us</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Precision Automation",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Precision Automation"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
